                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9da77a11-685b-38c5-91c4-531d97a92e4a",
                        "entry_id": "86621049-c0b0-3694-accf-8c573d518cc0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "in vain"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "52c831e0-1e62-4f7c-8b22-b7e5a365aa58",
                                "sense_id": "9da77a11-685b-38c5-91c4-531d97a92e4a",
                                "text": "— Не поймёт-с никто́, потому́ что на э́то на́до не ина́че как име́ть дар приро́дный, и у меня́ уже́ не раз тако́й о́пыт был, что я преподава́л, но всё вту́не оста́лось; но позво́льте, об э́том по́сле.",
                                "translation": "“Nobody will understand it, sir, because for that nothing else but a natural gift will do, and more than once I’ve had the same experience, that I teach, but it’s all in vain. But, excuse me, we’ll get to that later.”",
                                "english": "“Nobody will understand it, sir, because for that nothing else but a natural gift will do, and more than once I’ve had the same experience, that I teach, but it’s all in vain. But, excuse me, we’ll get to that later.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
